composite \verb{sum_\{j != k\} sign(r_kj) z_j}. Its one-sided p-value compares the
statistic with \code{n_perm} permutations of \code{z_k} within the centre (within
\code{strata}, if given), as \verb{(1 + #\{permuted >= observed\}) / (n_perm + 1)}
